                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Stalls are talking of nothing else. A costing.\" The watchwoman eyes the crowd. \"Nobody's bought less and nobody's sold less. Move along, or buy something.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "minuted"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Written down. Fine.\" She nods at the crowd. \"I'll write something down too: square's calm.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "subscribed"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"An owner, they say.\" She is unimpressed. \"The stalls pay for this square. If you're paying for the stalls now, you know where to find me.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "conditions": [
                    {
                        "flag": "meeting_fate",
                        "equals": "walked"
                    }
                ],
                "once": true,
                "text": "\"Walked out on them. Half the square cheered when the carters told it.\" She didn't. \"The other half's waiting to see what it costs.\"",
                "choices": [
                    {
                        "label": "Leave them to it.",
                        "end": true
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
